      "writtenOn": "2024-09-10T20:52:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It might be worth experimenting with having these be set on the `UniformTracker2` and only modified when there is a change. We could also remember the last set `index` to skip lookups entirely.\n\nThis would also let this class control configuring the BindBufferInfo for UBO or SSBO mode, and separately expose the ssbo index, even if it\u0027s still being calculated the same way internally.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 217,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "35b47140be87610663b004b40ab539aeec16f541",
